<lb n="11"/>hat <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> umb die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebührende</unclear> participation der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nodturfft</unclear> an=
